      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MILLIE'S MEMORY (5) showed plenty of fight first up with a sound on pace third over 1020m at this track. Placed second up and no excuses here over the extra trip. Can slide across and shed her Maiden tag. THIS AIN'T TEXAS (9) fifth up today and never appeared comfortable in the heavy (9) going when tenth over 1200m at this track a month ago. Races best with her runs spaced and look for a much better showing today. HAMPTON STYLE (4) returned for her second campaign with a tidy second over 1200m at Goulburn. Drops in weight and gets her chance from the good gate. HAMPE (1) is resuming from a lengthy break. Heavily supported on debut ($1.80 fav), with a game on-pace third over 1175m at Albury last December. Back with the one trial and the winkers go on.",
